      ],
      "left_column_words": 417,
      "right_column_words": 426,
      "first_text": "evaluation table. No seed is imputed, duplicated, or replaced\nafter examining its score.\nSeed 987 is not part of this primary comparison. Earlier\nrobust-training code constructs an",
      "last_text": " seed-\nmatched regime comparison, not an exactly compute-matched\nor augmentation-only causal intervention. Resolved per-run\nconfigurations would be needed to establish the latter.\n",
      "out_of_bounds": []
    },
